# Line endings are part of the content: basepack.json holds the SHA-256 of
# files and of itself, so a CRLF checkout on Windows would change a hash
# nobody edited (work order 335, question 6).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
